#: Game.Levels.Tutorial.L03_Apply
msgid "## The §0 Tactic\n"
"\n"
"The **§1** tactic works *backwards*. If your goal is §2 and you know a theorem\n"
"§3, then §4 changes the goal from §5 to §6.\n"
"\n"
"### Example\n"
"\n"
"If your goal is §7 and you have §8, then §9 changes the goal to §10.\n"
"\n"
"This is like working backwards in a proof: To prove Q, it suffices to prove P, because\n"
"P implies Q.\n"
"\n"
